{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他忽然觉得有件事不能轻轻带过，身体发紧，像逼自己站直又想停下。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M3\", \"M15\", \"M20\", \"M21\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"触动先于理解到来；他还没认出在意的对象，身体已先作出郑重反应。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M20\", \"M21\", \"M13\", \"M17\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"几次想抓住这份感受，念头却散开，只浮出似曾相识的亲近和说不清的失落。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M2\", \"M7\", \"M8\", \"M16\", \"M18\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他仍认不出这份亲切指向什么；似曾相识，也不能让它变成眼前的现实。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M7\", \"M8\", \"M12\", \"M14\", \"M16\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"临近末尾，他仍没认清这份亲切，身体却先找到一点向前的支点。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M23\", \"M29\", \"M33\", \"M41\", \"M42\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"亲切几次浮现又消失，却始终没有彻底散去；他发现自己仍想再靠近它。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [],\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M23\", \"M33\", \"M38\", \"M41\", \"M42\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现这阵触动没有随停顿散去，不能再把它当作一时的惊动略过。\",\n    \"他发现自己还没认清这份亲切指向什么，却已经想继续靠近它。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B1\",\n      \"why\": \"召唤与等待回声的听感可以表现他想触及某种回应，却不足以确定他在向某个人表达心意，或正在等待某个人回应；这一指向暂时不能落实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B2\",\n      \"why\": \"失落究竟来自愤怒、遗憾还是怀念，听感没有给出区分依据；也无法确定他具体在失去什么，因此只能保留尚未命名的失落，不能替他确定情绪对象。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f65ffbc3-bf76-49bb-8bca-dbf708ed2dcc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T230722956045Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.812, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T23:08:40.790884+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c935dab148e5ab4cf44d403e56a6f041b236794f1a27436e587696550ef3a9af", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T230722956045Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "19ebdf0dbe45536fd73cbc47e4b33c087ca00c554af1a66334dd940973f814cd"}}}
